nt; follow event seating, pedestrian-control, and guest-access instructions.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hsc-dean-tassel-turn","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Dean’s Tassel Turn","title":"Let the Dean Turn the Tassel","subtitle":"One individual gesture marks the new graduate","notes":"Watch the stage closely: Hampden-Sydney’s dean turns each graduate’s tassel immediately before the graduate processes across the stage.","short_summary":"Instead of a collective tassel move, Hampden-Sydney marks each degree transition one graduate at a time.","evidence_claim":"The College’s commencement traditions program states that the Dean of Students turns each graduate’s tassel from right to left before the graduate crosses the stage.","source_url":"https://www.hsc.edu/Documents/Commencement/CommencProgram2017.pdf","source_title":"Hampden-Sydney College Commencement 2017 Program","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2017-05-14","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The gesture takes place during commencement and is visible subject to the current ceremony’s guest and seating arrangements.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hsc-founders-day","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Founders Day Convocation","title":"Mark November 10 with Founders Day","subtitle":"The College commemorates its 1775 opening","notes":"Check the College calendar for the year’s convocation details, then use the program to connect the speakers and ceremony to H-SC’s founding mission.","short_summary":"Founders Day gathers the campus around the date Hampden-Sydney first held classes in 1775.","evidence_claim":"Hampden-Sydney held a Founders Day convocation on November 10, 2025, marking the 250th anniversary of its founding and first classes in 1775.","source_url":"https://www.hsc.edu/news-index/founders-day-250","source_title":"Hampden-Sydney C